Introduction Of Laravel
`` 

Laravel is an open-source PHP framework designed to make web development easier and more efficient by simplifying common tasks like routing, authentication, and database management. 
It follows the Model-View-Controller (MVC) architectural pattern and provides an elegant syntax, making it a popular choice for developers.

``
Why Use Laravel?
``
Rapid Development: Streamlines development with built-in tools and predefined templates.
Scalability: Ideal for small to enterprise-level applications.
Community Support: Large, active community and extensive documentation.
